{
  "uid": "timetracker-negocio",
  "title": "TimeTracker — Negocio",
  "description": "Métricas funcionales (§22): timers, horas registradas, trabajo y usuarios. El frontend/RUM y el seguimiento de sesiones viven en el dashboard 'TimeTracker — Frontend y RUM'. Los contadores se muestran redondeados: increase() extrapola y devolvía valores como '5,3 logins fallidos'. Las ventanas siguen al selector de tiempo.",
  "tags": [
    "timetracker",
    "negocio"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Empresa",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(timetracker_timers_started_total, tenant_id)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Seguimiento de tiempo",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Timers iniciados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_started_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "iniciados"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Timers detenidos",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_stopped_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "detenidos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sin cerrar en el rango",
      "description": "Iniciados menos detenidos dentro de la ventana visible. Es una aproximación, no un inventario: un timer abierto ayer y cerrado hoy descuadra el saldo. Sirve para detectar la tendencia de la alerta 'timers abandonados' (§27); el número exacto de timers abiertos hay que consultarlo en la base.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "clamp_min(round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_started_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range]))) - round(sum(increase(timetracker_timers_stopped_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range]))), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "sin cerrar"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Horas registradas",
      "description": "minutes_tracked_total convertido a horas. Es la métrica que sustenta los reportes y el cálculo de costos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "h",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "purple"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(timetracker_minutes_tracked_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])) / 60",
          "legendFormat": "horas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cargas manuales",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "yellow"
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_time_entries_created_manual_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "manuales"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Actividad de timers por empresa",
      "description": "tenant.id como dimensión (§22): distingue si algo afecta a una empresa o a todas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 40,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (tenant_id) (increase(timetracker_timers_started_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "empresa {{tenant_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Minutos registrados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "m",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (tenant_id) (increase(timetracker_minutes_tracked_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "empresa {{tenant_id}}"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trabajo y usuarios",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Issues creados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_issues_created_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "issues"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Proyectos creados",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_projects_created_total{tenant_id=~\"$tenant\"}[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "proyectos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reportes generados",
      "description": "Desglosado por tipo de reporte.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum by (report_type) (increase(timetracker_reports_generated_total[$__range])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{report_type}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inicios de sesión: exitosos vs fallidos",
      "description": "Un pico de fallidos sin aumento de exitosos es la señal de §27. Se cuenta sin registrar el email, para no almacenar datos personales.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "drawStyle": "bars"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "fallidos"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "exitosos"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_users_logged_in_logins_total[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "exitosos"
        },
        {
          "expr": "round(sum(increase(timetracker_login_failed_logins_total[$__interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "fallidos"
        }
      ],
      "interval": "1m"
    }
  ]
}
